ressed gene (DEG) in breast cancer (BRCA), ovarian serous cystadenocarcinoma (OV), and kidney renal clear cell carcinoma (KIRC). Finally, we showed that the overexpression of RIBC2 enhanced the expression of TRIM37 and down-regulated TRAF2. TRIM37 is a member of the tripartite motif (TRIM) family involved in developmental patterning and oncogenesis while TRAF2 is associated with the signal transduction from members of the TNF receptor superfamily. CONCLUSIONS: Our reports identified a common variant that exerts a dramatic impact on expression efficiency and provides further functional insight into RIBC2.\n\n",
